5	/// <summary>
6	/// Sample consumer service demonstrating the permission-registration flow:
7	/// every action is annotated with <c>[RequirePermission]</c>; on startup the service
8	/// discovers those permissions and pushes a manifest to the Identity Facade, which
9	/// mirrors them into Keycloak realm roles so they appear in token claims.
10	/// Exactly ten distinct permissions are declared — see <c>Identity.Sample.Tests</c>.
11	/// </summary>
